              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "restinguō, restinguere — \"to put out, to quench\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Vigilēs incendium aquā restinxērunt. The watchmen put out the fire with water."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "restinguō, restinguere, restinxī, restinctum: close to exstinguō (taught). Also of thirst: sitim restinguere."
            }
          ]
        },
