              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ambūrō, ambūrere — \"to scorch, to singe\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ignis manūs eius ambussit, sed vīvus fūgit. The fire scorched his hands, but he got away alive."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ambūrō, ambūrere, ambussī, ambustum: to burn all round, not right through."
            }
          ]
        },
